    "Text Editing" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文字编辑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text fields keep standard macOS editing keys. Dialogs share the Apply/Cancel assignments above. Numeric fields use Up/Down, with Shift for larger steps. Standard macOS commands include ⌘Q to quit and ⌃⌘F for full screen. The shortcut editor itself always uses Return to save and Esc to cancel when not recording." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文本栏保留 macOS 的标准编辑按键。对话框共用上方的“应用/取消”快捷键。数值栏使用上/下箭头调整，按住 Shift 可加大步长。macOS 标准命令包括 ⌘Q 退出和 ⌃⌘F 全屏。快捷键编辑器本身在未录制时始终用 Return 存储、Esc 取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text Size" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文字大小"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text · Double-click to edit" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文字 · 连按两下以编辑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text-editing shortcuts need Command, Option, or Control so they do not replace normal typing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文字编辑快捷键必须包含 Command、Option 或 Control，以免取代正常输入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Texture" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "纹理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That profile isn’t a CMYK output profile." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该配置文件不是 CMYK 输出配置文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That selection is too detailed to outline. Try a different Tolerance, or turn on Contiguous." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该选区过于复杂，无法生成轮廓。请尝试其他容差，或打开“连续”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That shape is too large. A shape can cover up to %lld megapixels." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该形状太大。形状最多可覆盖 %lld 百万像素。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That text box exceeds the %@-pixel or %lld-megapixel limit." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该文本框超出了 %1$@ 像素或 %2$lld 百万像素的限制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The 2012 response. Calibration reaches most of the strength used by Version 6." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2012 版的响应方式。校准可达到版本 6 的大部分强度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The blur where the line ends, and past it" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "直线终点及其之外的模糊量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The blur where the line starts" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "直线起点的模糊量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The brush trails the pointer on a string this long, so a shaky hand still draws a smooth line" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "画笔像被这么长的绳子牵着跟随指针，即使手抖也能画出平滑的线条"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The canvas could not be rendered. Try a smaller canvas." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法渲染画布。请尝试较小的画布。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The characters to draw with, in any order: each spot gets the one whose ink best matches its tone" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用于绘制的字符，顺序不限：每个位置使用墨量与其色调最匹配的字符"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The copied layers exceed this project’s %lld-megapixel limit." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "拷贝的图层超出了此项目 %lld 百万像素的限制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The font “%@” isn’t installed, so the text was drawn with the system font." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "未安装字体“%@”，因此文字已使用系统字体绘制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The height of each line of characters" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每行字符的高度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The image could not be encoded." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法对图像进行编码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The image could not be read. It may be damaged or unavailable." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法读取图像。图像可能已损坏或不可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The layer mask couldn’t be converted to 8-bit grayscale and was skipped." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法将图层蒙版转换为 8 位灰度，已跳过。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The layer mask is turned off. Shift-click its thumbnail to turn it on, then paint." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "图层蒙版已关闭。按住 Shift 点按其缩览图以打开，然后再绘画。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The object mask could not be rendered." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法渲染对象蒙版。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Photoshop file could not be read. It may be damaged or incomplete." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法读取该 Photoshop 文件。文件可能已损坏或不完整。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Photoshop stroke isn’t supported on shape layers and was omitted." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "形状图层不支持 Photoshop 描边，已忽略。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Photoshop text warp was omitted." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已忽略 Photoshop 文字变形。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The smart object was rasterized. Linked contents can’t be edited." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "智能对象已栅格化，链接的内容无法编辑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The trimmed image dimensions are invalid." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "裁切后的图像尺寸无效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There isn’t enough memory to make that selection." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "内存不足，无法创建该选区。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These layers supply live masks" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些图层提供了实时蒙版"
          }
        }
      }
    },
